{"product_id":"sorry-dad","title":"Sorry Dad!","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis quirky picture book by the author and illustrator of Pi-Rat follows a day in the life of a cheeky cat and his long-suffering dad. They may be the bestest friends, but sometimes the little cat can't help but get in a spot of trouble and find himself on the naughty step...Will he find the right way to say \"Sorry Dad\"?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 260 x 280\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Maxine Lee\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781848574045\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 32\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45359422963865,"sku":"BLK-3-9781848574045","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6813a1abd2604_22464672.jpg?v=1752084434","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/sorry-dad","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}